92,\"iPad13,6\":66670592,\"iPad13,7\":66670592,\"iPad13,1\":66670592,\"iPad13,2\":66670592}},\"relationships\":{\"app-events\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/app-events?l=en-US\",\"data\":[]},\"reviews\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/reviews?l=en-US\",\"next\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/reviews?l=en-US\u0026offset=10\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"9474887392\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-05T18:44:20Z\",\"review\":\"I absolutely love HabitKit. It is by far the best habit tracking app I have ever used. The tile-based grid charts make it super easy to visualize my progress, and the customization options for the dashboard are a great touch. The ability to choose my own colors, icons, and descriptions really helps me to personalize the app to my own needs and goals.\\n\\nOne of the things I love most about HabitKit is the motivation it provides. Seeing the tiles on my dashboard fill up with color as I complete my habits is a great way to stay motivated and on track. The app is also very user-friendly and easy to navigate. I highly recommend HabitKit to anyone looking to form new habits or break old ones.\\n\\nOverall, I would give HabitKit a solid 5 out of 5 stars. It has truly made a difference in my life and I am so grateful to have found it. Thank you, for creating such a wonderful app!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Chevy Phillip\",\"title\":\"The Ultimate Habit Tracking App!\"}},{\"id\":\"9475276997\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-05T21:22:57Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34150130,\"body\":\"Thank you so much for taking the time to review HabitKit and for sharing your experience! I appreciate your support and am grateful that you have chosen to use HabitKit. Thank you for your review, and I hope you continue to find success with the app.\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-08T08:18:03Z\"},\"review\":\"I absolutely love HabitKit! It is by far the best habit tracking app I have ever used. The tile-based grid charts make it super easy to visualize my progress, and the customization options for the dashboard are a great touch. The ability to choose my own colors, icons, and descriptions really helps me to personalize the app to my own needs and goals.\\n\\nOne of the things I love most about HabitKit is the motivation it provides. Seeing the tiles on my dashboard fill up with color as I complete my habits is a great way to stay motivated and on track. The app is also very user-friendly and easy to navigate. I highly recommend HabitKit to anyone looking to form new habits or break old ones.\\n\\nOverall, I would give HabitKit a solid 5 out of 5 stars. It has truly made a difference in my life and I am so grateful to have found it. Thank you, Sebastian, for creating such a wonderful app!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Chevy Phillip\",\"title\":\"The Ultimate Habit Tracking App!\"}},{\"id\":\"9859117108\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-04-25T10:34:34Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":36222346,\"body\":\"Thank you very much! It really means a lot to me that you've taken the time to write such an extensive review of my app. I'm really glad that the app had a positive effect on your life and I hope you'll stick with all the habits you created.\\n\\nThanks again and all the best, Sebastian\",\"modified\":\"2023-04-28T09:12:29Z\"},\"review\":\"As someone who has always struggled with maintaining consistency in my daily habits, I have tried numerous habit tracking apps in the past. However, none of them have managed to motivate and engage me as much as HabitKit! This app has completely transformed my approach to habit tracking and has helped me build lasting habits that I can finally stick to.\\n\\nThe daily notifications are a gentle but effective reminder to complete my habits, making it nearly impossible to forget or procrastinate. The best part, though, is the GitHub contribution-style chart that visually represents my progress. This brilliant feature has turned habit tracking into an exciting game, where I eagerly work to maintain my streak and fill in the chart.\\n\\nThe interface is clean, intuitive, and user-friendly, allowing me to easily add, edit, and manage my habits. The customization options are also impressive, enabling me to tailor the notifications and chart according to my preferences.\\n\\nHabitKit has not only helped me stay consistent in my daily routines but has also significantly improved my productivity and overall well-being. I am genuinely grateful for this app and highly recommend it to anyone looking to build and maintain healthy habits. Give HabitKit a try, and I promise you won't be disappointed!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"upsetti with this spagetti\",\"title\":\"Effective and Motivating Habit Tracker!\"}},{\"id\":\"9508254597\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-15T01:07:29Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34301376,\"body\":\"Thank you for your review! I'm really glad to hear that HabitKit feels right for you and that you like the visual display of your streak. Thanks for using HabitKit!\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-16T07:07:46Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been using the “don’t break the chain” method of habit building for about a billion years. I’ve used apps and my own paper trackers. They all work, more or less, but some just feel better than others, and with something simple like habit tracking, feel is 90% of what’s important.\\n\\nHabitKit has FEEL son!\\n\\nThere’s something about the simplicity of the app and the ease of logging that just feels right. But more than that, the visual display of your streak is the best I’ve come across. It’s RIGHT in your face. There’s no ignoring it… and that’s a very very good thing.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"dörkåsbord\",\"title\":\"Fresh take on an old style of habit tracking\"}},{\"id\":\"9410648676\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2022-12-18T21:53:44Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":33834604,\"body\":\"Thank you for your positive review of HabitKit!  I'm glad that you find the app to be a good value at its current price point. I hope that HabitKit continues to be a helpful tool for you as you work towards your goals. Thank you for your support!\",\"modified\":\"2022-12-20T14:39:39Z\"},\"review\":\"HabitKit is an exciting app. It's gorgeous to see, it's a joy to use, it may well be best in class. Also: The developer is friendly and responsive to feature requests... HabitKit has arrived just in time for the new year; I expect to use the app each- and every day... I'm happy to see that it's buyable (subscription not required!) and right now, priced at just 15 bucks, it's well worth it too... Give this app a try -- it's great already and it'll get only better!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Wooooooooooooooo0\",\"title\":\"Great app, great price\"}},{\"id\":\"9466333479\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-03T13:11:03Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34109438,\"body\":\"Thank you so much for your kind words. Lots of improvements and new features will come to HabitKit in the future!\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-05T11:57:29Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been looking for a solution to help keep track of my workouts, reading, and alcohol consumption. Specifically, I wanted a solution that would let me visualize my progress in those areas. HabitKit nails the visualization for me. \\n\\nThe maker of HabitKit is also quick to respond to questions and suggestions, which is a great sign of what’s to come with this solution.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"eric.peters\",\"title\":\"Simple and visually effective\"}},{\"id\":\"9444885362\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2022-12-28T19:23:07Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34014486,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for your review and your feedback! I'll add this to the list of possible features for future updates!\",\"modified\":\"2022-12-30T15:48:05Z\"},\"review\":\"The app is beautifully made and approachable. My suggestions are reminders that keep bugging you until you complete something. Also it would be nice to have habits that can reoccur multiple times per day. For example 4 sets of 25 push-ups per day\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"thx you!\",\"title\":\"Well done\"}},{\"id\":\"9474660163\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-05T17:18:52Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34150143,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for your amazing review, Martin! \",\"modified\":\"2023-01-08T08:19:53Z\"},\"review\":\"This app is perfect. I really want to start reading, work out more regularly and drink water.. just being more healthy or conscious how I spend my day. And this really helps my forgetful mind to keep track of what I’ve done but also what I still need to do :D\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Martin Lasek\",\"title\":\"New Year New Me 2023!\"}},{\"id\":\"9807233885\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-04-10T15:10:10Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":35927111,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for taking the time to leave such a nice review! I really appreciate it!\",\"modified\":\"2023-04-13T04:39:52Z\"},\"review\":\"Been using this app to track a number of habits, and it’s very well made. The developer is very responsive and is really great with feedback. Highly recommended.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"GroovinChip\",\"title\":\"Well-made app with excellent and responsive developer\"}},{\"id\":\"9910561764\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-05-10T00:15:55Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":36480438,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for the great review, I'm really happy that you enjoy the app. Thanks for your support!\",\"modified\":\"2023-05-12T09:12:40Z\"},\"review\":\"I love this app! Love the feeling of checking things off a list \u0026 this app gives me that same satisfaction in helping me create healthy habits. Love the design \u0026 would recommend this app to anyone. Keep it up!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"bamburn\",\"title\":\"A New Favorite!\"}}]},\"top-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/top-in-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6444183590\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/6444183590?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=990\u0026salableAdamId=6444183590\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.99\",\"price\":0.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[],\"recurringSubscriptionPeriod\":\"P1M\"}],\"subscriptionFamilyRank\":1,\"subscriptionFamilyName\":\"HabitKit Pro\",\"offerName\":\"habitkit_0099_1m\",\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Unlimited access to all features\"},\"subscriptionFamilyId\":\"21044815\",\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/habitkit-pro-1-month/id6443918070\",\"isSubscription\":true,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"name\":\"HabitKit Pro (1 Month)\"}},{\"id\":\"6444258879\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/6444258879?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=14990\u0026salableAdamId=6444258879\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$14.99\",\"price\":14.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"habitkit_1799_lt\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"HabitKit Pro (Lifetime)\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Unlimited access to all features\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/habitkit-pro-lifetime/id6443918070\"}},{\"id\":\"6444190735\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/6444190735?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=5990\u0026salableAdamId=6444190735\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$5.99\",\"price\":5.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[],\"recurringSubscriptionPeriod\":\"P1Y\"}],\"subscriptionFamilyRank\":2,\"subscriptionFamilyName\":\"HabitKit Pro\",\"offerName\":\"habitkit_0599_1y\",\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Unlimited access to all features\"},\"subscriptionFamilyId\":\"21044815\",\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/habitkit-pro-1-year/id6443918070\",\"isSubscription\":true,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"name\":\"HabitKit Pro (1 Year)\"}}]},\"developer-other-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/developer-other-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1604437305\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1604437305?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Health \u0026 Fitness\",\"identifier\":\"HEALTH_AND_FITNESS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Contact Info\",\"identifier\":\"CONTACT_INFO\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Other Data\",\"identifier\":\"OTHER\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Purchases\",\"identifier\":\"PURCHASES\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"4+\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/liftbear-strength-log/id1604437305\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":5,\"ratingCount\":5,\"ratingCountList\":[0,0,0,0,5],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"5.0 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Health \u0026 Fitness\",\"name\":\"Liftbear - Strength Log\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"Sebastian Roehl\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 11.0 or later.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 11.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 11.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Build your workouts, track your sessions and gain insights. Liftbear is your new companion on your fitness journey and helps you keep track of weights, repetitions, exercises and workouts.\\n\\nSTAY ORGANIZED\\nKeep up with your routines by organizing your workouts and exercises in beautiful lists. Be in control of your data and manage it how you like. See the details of your workouts and explore relevant session data.\\n\\nGAIN INSIGHTS\\nExtract valuable insights out of your data. See your progress in specific exercises or muscle groups and decide when it is time to up the numbers. Liftbear will show your data in beautiful visualizations and charts.\\n\\nSTART TRACKING\\nTrack every workout, exercise, set, repetition, weight and time while you are working out. Liftbear tells you when your rest time is over, and it’s time to continue with the next set. Filter your data by week, month or year. See your full training history and have your data right at your hand. \\n\\nFEATURES\\n\\nStay Organized\\n- Create and organize your exercises by type and muscle groups\\n- Build your workouts and manage them in beautiful lists\\n- Add exercises and sets to workouts\\n- Adjust sets based on weights, repetitions and time\\n- Reorder exercises and sets\\n\\nGain Insights\\n- Filter training data by week, month and year\\n- Beautiful data visualizations of your exercise progress\\n- Muscle group distribution charts\\n- Consistency graph\\n\\nStart Tracking\\n- Log workouts, exercises, sets, repetitions and weight while working out\\n- Explore full training history\\n- Adjustable rest timer\\n- Choose from over 50 predefined exercises\\n\\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.liftbear.app/privacy/\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.liftbear.app\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes several bugfixes and performance optimizations.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-04T11:13:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes various bugfixes and UI optimizations.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-01T09:50:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes UI optimizations for large screens.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-10-25T07:49:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes the following new features:\\n- Track your body metrics like weight, bodyfat percentage or biceps size\\n- Share your completed sessions or new personal bests on social media\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-12T05:04:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release contains several performance optimizations and UI improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-21T11:14:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes several bugfixes, performance optimizations and UI improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-17T10:00:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes several new and exciting features:\\n- Secondary muscle groups for exercises\\n- Notes in workouts and sessions\\n- New exercise type: Assisted Weight\\n- New workout icons\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-12T04:24:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update contains several bugfixes and performance optimizations.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-29T06:06:54Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update contains the following updates:\\n- 1RM calculation\\n- Alternative exercises\\n- New action menu design\\n- Session ratings\\n- Exercise timer countdown\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-27T07:47:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We are working hard to make Liftbear better with every version. This update contains several bugfixes and performance enhancements. It is now possible to \\\"Sign in with Google\\\".\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-22T07:52:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We are working hard to make Liftbear better with every version. This update contains several bugfixes and performance enhancements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-30T19:36:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We are working hard to make Liftbear better with every version. This update includes the following changes:\\n\\n- Supersets: Combine multiple exercises to supersets in workouts and sessions\\n- Warm-up Sets: Mark a set as warm-up set, which won't be accounted in your statistics\\n- Weekly Session Goals: Add your weekly goal and see your progress\\n- Weekday Distribution Graph: Explore which days are youre favourite training days\\n- Records: Find out on which days you made new records in which exercise\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-29T13:28:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This version includes several bugfixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-09T09:51:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This version includes several bugfixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-01T18:54:36Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update includes the following changes:\\n\\n- Timebased exercises\\n- Filter exercises by muscle group\\n- Over 50 predefined exercises to choose from\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-01T05:54:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update includes the following changes:\\n\\n- 7 day trial for Liftbear Pro\\n- Theme picker\\n- Consistency graph\\n- Progress charts overhaul\\n- Pin workouts and exercises\\n- Search workouts and exercises\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-16T10:58:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update contains the following changes:\\n\\n- German translation\\n- New lists look\\n- New buttons look\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-05T13:44:03Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-26T05:36:38Z\"}],\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1604437305\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026