/917457194?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"genreNames\":[],\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"name\":\"Modum B.V.\",\"mediaType\":\"Mobile Software Applications\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/modum-b-v/id917457194\"}}]},\"genres\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1661833753/genres?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6007\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6007?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Productivity\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6007\"}},{\"id\":\"6002\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6002?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Utilities\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6002\"}}]}},\"meta\":{\"contentVersion\":{\"MZ_INDEXER\":1684517699524,\"RTCI\":1680046565731}}},{\"id\":\"1659811306\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1659811306?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Purchases\",\"identifier\":\"PURCHASES\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"4+\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/commit-everyday-consistency/id1659811306\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.1,\"ratingCount\":12,\"ratingCountList\":[1,1,1,2,7],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.1 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"name\":\"Commit: Everyday Consistency\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"Aidar Nugmanov\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"12.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"TRANSFORM YOUR MIND AND BODY WITH 75 SOFT/HARD CHALLENGE\\n75 days of discipline, hard work, and progress: are you up for the challenge? You wanna follow a diet, drink a gallon of water, read 10 pages and complete 2 workouts a day? We will help you manage your progress and complete the renowned 75 hard program.\\n\\nCOMMIT TO HABITS\\nYou commit yourself for a change by creating a new habit with customizable regularity that suits only you.\\n\\nVISUALIZE YOUR PROGRESS\\nElegantly designed grid enables you to focus on the big picture and see the power of consistency and compounding. So you won't feel the pressure when missing some tasks.\\n\\nFEELINGS OVER FIGURES\\nWe believe that stats and dates are not important. What matters most is how you feel. That's why by default the app operates in mode with minimum visual elements.\\n\\nSTAY ON TRACK WITH WIDGETS\\nGet a quick view of your daily habits or stay aligned with the big picture of last month's recap. Track your progress right on your home screen with Commit's widgets.\\n\\nSHARE YOUR PROGRESS AND INSPIRE OTHERS\\nSpread positivity by sharing your success and motivate others to achieve their goals with you.\\n\\nCALENDAR VIEW\\nFor those who feels more comfortable seeing the picture spread across the months and dates.\\n\\nFOCUS ON ONE HABIT WITH EASE\\nFilter habits and stay focused on what matters most.\\n\\nMORNING AND EVENING HABIT REMINDERS: NEVER MISS A BEAT\\nMake progress effortless with tailored reminders that help you stay consistent and focused.\\n\\nDELIGHTFUL INTERACTIVITY\\nSnappy feedback and fluidity of the interfaces make navigating and using it feel like a breeze.\\n\\nCONTROL YOUR HISTORY\\nToggling completion of the given habit is allowed both for the current day and the days in the past.\\n\\nNEED HELP?\\nSupport: https://www.trycommit.app/support\\nTerms of Use: https://www.trycommit.app/terms\\nPrivacy Policy:  https://www.trycommit.app/privacy\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.4.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've received reports from some users that their history is resetting, and this version includes a fix for that issue. We apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nCommit Team\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-30T10:12:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have a big update for you.\\n\\n- Widgets: Now you can get a quick view of your daily habits or stay aligned with the big picture of last month's recap. Track your progress right from your home screen. To add them, long-tap on the home screen and search for \\\"Commit\\\" from the apps list.\\n- Filter on a habit: Stay focused on what matters most. Simply tap on \\\"all habits\\\" on the “all” tab and select a habit to see its history.\\n- Share your habit progress and motivate others to achieve their goals with you.\\n- We have added support for Kazakh and Russian languages. You can access these languages by going to \\\"Settings\\\". Support for other languages is coming soon!\\n\\nWe also have a special offer for those participating in the 75 Hard/Soft Challenge. 75 days of discipline, hard work, and progress: are you up for the challenge? Update the app and see what we have prepared for you.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nCommit Team\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-25T06:34:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have added notifications to help you stay committed to your habits! \\n\\nNotifications could be sent twice a day: one in the morning and one in the evening. You can always manage your preferences on the Settings page.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nCommit team\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-16T13:59:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.1.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-25T20:08:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-12T21:31:23Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-03T17:52:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-02T12:50:53Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2022.12.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"It's time to set goals for the new year. Commit yourself to the next year by creating habits and sharing with friends on your favorite social networks!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-30T21:22:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-28T08:20:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-26T05:43:02Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://trycommit.app/\",\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=16598