dget to start writing even faster.\\nSecure: use the official Notion authorisation method, without generating your tokens manually. Your data is transmitted directly to Notion.\\nOffline: notes saved without internet connection will be sent later.\\n\\nGet the \\\"Instant Notion Pro\\\" subscription to use additional features:\\n\\nHome Screen Widgets: create widgets with your tags and start creating notes even faster\\nCreate tags in the app: add new tags without opening Notion\\n\\nLicensed application end user license agreement (EULA):\\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"websiteUrl\":\"https://twitter.com/michal_creates\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added Japanese language\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-29T10:46:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"URLs from the title/body of your note will now be clickable in Notion\\nSaving notes when offline is faster now\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-16T10:37:48Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"URLs from the title/body of your note will now be clickable in Notion\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-05T06:29:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added support for multiple databases. You can now configure both select and multi-select properties as a tags source.\\nAdded the \\\"Instant Notion Pro\\\" subscription with Home Screen Widget and ability to create tags in the app\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-23T18:07:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added support for multiple databases\\nAdded the \\\"Instant Notion Pro\\\" subscription with Home Screen Widget and ability to create tags in the app\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-08T23:56:40Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added support for multiple databases\\nAdded the \\\"Instant Notion Pro\\\" subscription with Home Screen Widget and ability to create tags in the app\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-03T00:15:43Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added support for multiple databases\\nAdded the \\\"Instant Notion Pro\\\" subscription with Home Screen Widget and ability to create tags in the app\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-31T17:36:14Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added support for multiple databases\\nAdded the \\\"Instant Notion Pro\\\" subscription with Home Screen Widget and ability to create tags in the app\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-31T11:11:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.9.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed issues with authentication with Notion\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-21T17:46:36Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.9.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"iOS 16 Lock Screen Widget - add it to start writing notes even faster\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-10-05T10:27:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.9.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Ability to save multiple notes with the same content\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-04T20:43:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.9.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed. a bug related to saving notes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-02T23:30:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.9.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added a way to divide a note into page title and body\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-31T11:28:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.9.4\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-26T06:16:23Z\"}],\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"produ